Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fill s2b-efficiency: prove
 exists_interactiveHandlerMachine (T2)

New helper modules under Games/Efficiency/:
- Replay: ReplaysFrom and buildComp_of_replaysFrom (S3), and the cost
  scaling lemma costBoundedBy_mul.
- Interactive: the replay machine iRaw of an interactive handler (adversary,
  call and finalization phases, one activation per round, the unreplayed
  outer log in the state), its polynomial time and its round lemmas.
- InteractiveSpec: the raw call/implementation/finalization (iCall, iImpl,
  iFinish), the replay invariant and the phase inductions (fin_phase,
  call_phase, adv_phase), and the functional equation iRaw_spec.
T2's sketch and the module docstring (status, Contents) are updated.
